3. MATHEMATICAL INDICATORS ENGINE (FORMULAS FROM SCRATCH)
====================================================================
Calculate all technical indicators over the entire historical warmup data row-by-row before filtering for the current session. Do not calculate using only the current day's candles.
- EMA (9 & 20): Use the standard Exponential Moving Average formula: Multiplier = 2 / (Period + 1). EMA_today = (Close_today * Multiplier) + (EMA_yesterday * (1 - Multiplier)).
- RSI (14): Calculate using Wilder's smoothing technique. Delta = Close.diff(). Gain = delta.clip(lower=0), Loss = -delta.clip(upper=0). AvgGain = Gain.ewm(alpha=1/14).mean(), AvgLoss = Loss.ewm(alpha=1/14).mean(). RS = AvgGain / AvgLoss. RSI = 100 - (100 / (1 + RS)). Handle division by zero by setting RSI to 100 if AvgLoss is 0.
- ATR (14): True Range (TR) = Max(High - Low, Abs(High - Previous Close), Abs(Low - Previous Close)). Smooth TR using an ewm alpha of 1/14. Calculate 'ATR_Pct' = (ATR / Close) * 100.

